            "notes": "Now that we have [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) it's time to pivot to AP. If I'm not mistaken, one burst of mediblaster on an enemy while you have 50+ AP should now immediately trigger [Torpedo Glide](item_b04180a3-c2b2-409c-959e-77e3af6bc7d8) \n\nIf you can afford [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) definitely prioritize that. [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) is the next best alternative if you're short on cash.\n\n[Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) is another good pickup to further reduce our cooldowns. If you're really up on money also get  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) for some more cooldown reduction and survivability.\n\nI'm tempted to say get [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689) over [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0), but I think having overhealth that sticks around for longer is much better.",
