            "notes": "It's hard for me to predict how things will go after round 3, but I think the move is to pick [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) as your next perk. This round is where I feel a lot of builds really start to ramp up, so I'd like to have some survivability to avoid getting suddenly blown up.\n\nIf you're too poor for [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) get [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0). Or if you got it like that grab both to amp up your cooldown reduction.",
