            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-01T05:01:43.191787+00:00",
            "notes": "Our torpedoes are our best form of healing, so for round 5 pick [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40) as your power.\n\nI actually haven't been able to play with this yet, but [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) should absolutely juice this build. Your cooldown reduction should be so high at this point that by the time you've fired your torpedoes, glide should already be back up.\n\nIf you're just short on cash I'd recommend [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8). If you're really low, hold it down on [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0), [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), or whatever greens you can muster.",
