            "created_at": "2025-08-01T05:01:43.191787+00:00",
            "notes": "On round 6 I'd pick up [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) as our next perk. The weapon power is going to be a nice bump and our build makes it very easy to maintain a full five stacks of AP.\n\nIf you feel like you're dying a lot or having issues with survivability I recommend picking  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) instead or swapping [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0).",
