            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-01T05:01:43.191787+00:00",
            "notes": "I was first tempted to have [Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212) as the final power, but I actually think [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) is a better option. It makes great use of the builds short cooldowns and high AP to keep your teammates stocked up on overhealth.\n\nFor our last perk I think [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) is a good final touch. It's always nice having your ult handy to flip a team fight when the lights get bright.\n\nOnce again if you feel like you need a bump in survivability, swap one of your purples for [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8).",
